LangString INSTALLER_LAUNCH ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Iniciar ahora"
LangString INSTALLER_LAUNCH_FAILED ${LANG_ENGLISH} "tBelt Code could not be launched. Retry, or clear Launch now and close the installer."
LangString INSTALLER_LAUNCH_FAILED ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "No se pudo iniciar tBelt Code. Vuelve a intentarlo, o desmarca Iniciar ahora y cierra el instalador."
LangString INSTALLER_UI_ERROR ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The installer could not initialize its window. Close it and try again."
LangString INSTALLER_UI_ERROR ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "El instalador no pudo inicializar su ventana. Ciérralo y vuelve a intentarlo."
LangString INSTALLER_THEME_ERROR ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Use /THEME=auto, /THEME=light or /THEME=dark."
LangString INSTALLER_THEME_ERROR ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Usa /THEME=auto, /THEME=light o /THEME=dark."
LangString INSTALLER_FAILED ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installation did not finish. Close this installer and retry. If the problem persists, download the installer again."
LangString INSTALLER_FAILED ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "La instalación no terminó. Cierra este instalador y vuelve a intentarlo. Si el problema continúa, descarga el instalador de nuevo."
LangString INSTALLER_RUNNING ${LANG_ENGLISH} "tBelt Code is running. Quit it from the system tray and try again."
LangString INSTALLER_RUNNING ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "tBelt Code se está ejecutando. Ciérralo desde la bandeja del sistema y vuelve a intentarlo."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_INVALID ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose a full local folder path. Drive roots, system folders, links and special characters are not supported."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_INVALID ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Elige la ruta completa de una carpeta local. No se admiten raíces de unidad, carpetas del sistema, vínculos ni caracteres especiales."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_OWNERSHIP ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose an empty folder or the registered tBelt Code installation folder."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_OWNERSHIP ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Elige una carpeta vacía o la carpeta de instalación registrada de tBelt Code."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_WRITABLE ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This location is not writable. Choose a folder available to the current user."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_WRITABLE ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "No se puede escribir en esta ubicación. Elige una carpeta disponible para el usuario actual; el instalador no solicita permisos de administrador."
LangString INSTALLER_DISK_SPACE ${LANG_ENGLISH} "There is not enough free disk space. Choose another location."
LangString INSTALLER_DISK_SPACE ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "No hay suficiente espacio libre en el disco. Elige otra ubicación."
LangString INSTALLER_PER_USER ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This installer supports the current user only. Uninstall the existing all-users installation first."
LangString INSTALLER_PER_USER ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Este instalador solo admite el usuario actual. Desinstala primero la instalación existente para todos los usuarios."
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_FAILED ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The application files could not be extracted."
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_FAILED ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "No se pudieron extraer los archivos de la aplicación."
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_HINT ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Security software may have blocked a file, or the disk may be full. Close this installer and try again. If it keeps failing, send us the error details below."
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_HINT ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Puede que un antivirus haya bloqueado un archivo, o que el disco esté lleno. Cierra este instalador y vuelve a intentarlo. Si sigue fallando, envíanos los detalles del error de abajo."
