LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_COLLAPSE ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Ocultar detalles"
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_SAVED ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The full report was saved to %s"
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_SAVED ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "El informe completo se guardó en %s"
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_UNSAVED ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The full report could not be saved. Use Copy error details to keep it."
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_UNSAVED ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "No se pudo guardar el informe completo. Usa Copiar detalles del error para conservarlo."
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_COPIED ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Error details were copied to the clipboard."
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_COPIED ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Los detalles del error se copiaron al portapapeles."
